 best with the fast Steam Clean cycle that's chemical and odor-free."},{"type":"Headline","text":"Premium Glide Rack"},{"type":"Paragraph","text":"Our extending glide rack makes it easier to monitor and lift your food out of the oven."},{"type":"Headline","text":"Energy Efficient Cooking"},{"type":"Paragraph","text":"Use less energy while you cook with energy-efficient induction technology which heats the pan directly so less heat loss in the cooking process."},{"type":"Headline","text":"Compatible with most cookware"},{"type":"Paragraph","text":"Most stainless steel and cast iron cookware is compatible with induction elements. Rule of thumb: if a magnet sticks to the bottom of the cookware, it’s induction-compatible.1"},{"type":"Headline","text":"Star-K® Certified"},{"type":"Paragraph","text":"Sabbath Mode Star-K® Certified."},{"type":"Headline","text":"Convenient Bridge Elements"},{"type":"Paragraph","text":"Connects two elements to allow for simultaneous control, perfect for a griddle pan."},{"type":"Headline","text":"Soft-close oven door"},{"type":"Paragraph","text":"Soft-close hinges gently guide the oven door to a closed position."},{"type":"Headline","text":"Safer Cooktop Surface"},{"type":"Paragraph","text":"Induction heats your pan and the food in it, so the area around the pan stays cooler."},{"type":"Headline","text":"Smudge-Proof® Stainless Steel"},{"type":"Paragraph","text":"Resists fingerprints and cleans easily."},{"type":"Headline","text":"ADA Compliant"},{"type":"Paragraph","text":"Product complies with the Americans with Disabilities Act.*2"}],"documents":[{"label":"Complete Owner's Guide","url":"https://linqcdn.avbportal.com/documents/78490361-3a8d-4bfd-95b2-ae6108308dd4.pdf"},{"label":"Installation Instructions","url":"https://linqcdn.avbportal.com/documents/01d27a06-42d4-48fa-bd81-1426def5b4b1.pdf"},{"label":"Quick Start Guide","url":"https://linqcdn.avbportal.com/documents/0aca5644-2241-45d6-85c5-b5c862bda957.pdf"},{"label":"Specification Sheet